rule NoFigureWithoutAuthority
	statement: Law L1. A balance, rate, forecast, affordability result or executable amount that did not come from the bank's own records or a registered deterministic calculation must not be presented as banking truth. Quote money only from the Inr properties, with the date they are valid for (Account.BalanceAsOn).
	lineageTag: 384a0895-9b43-5ecf-8a67-66d888acafb4

	ruleReferencedEntity Account
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty PostedBalanceInr

		ruleReferencedProperty AvailableBalanceInr

		ruleReferencedProperty BalanceAsOn

	ruleReferencedEntity Loan
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty CurrentPrincipalInr

		ruleReferencedProperty EmiInr
